      "body": "Note for anyone reading this: we see matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals#1708 as a pre-requisite. It is fair to say that matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals#1708 has had a less than rapturous reception.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/1711#issuecomment-444813654"
