      "body": "ACK, would be a great feature to have this. Does anyone know to what degree this is already implemented in Synapse? Max retention only? Found these\r\n- https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/6358\r\n- https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/5815",
