      "author": "KnowledgeGarden",
      "date": "2024-08-16",
      "body": "Perhaps an extremely naive question, but here goes:\r\nSuppose I want to do something in a Matrix client much like, say, Kialo, events for which are new text messages, but they are situated in the context of a parent node, which, itself, is situated in a Pro-Con debate graph; the view painted would be, first, the graph, then, when a node is selected, the graph shifts to place that node as the local \"root\" at the top.\r\nMy question, then, is this: can an extensible message type allow for a type which entails an entire JSON graph object with individual nodes?\r\nMany thanks in advance - Jack",
