      "body": "@gordnhoo please make an issue on the [matrix-spec issue tracker](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec/issues?q=sort%3Aupdated-desc+is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen) instead with your feature request. From there, one can [write an MSC](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/#the-matrix-spec-process) to spec public profile language identifiers (perhaps built on [MSC4133](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4133), which recently merged to the spec, instead).\r\n\r\nAlso note that top-level (and on-topic) comments on MSCs are typically reserved for announcement or high-level status updates. Thanks!",
