      "author": "anoadragon453",
      "date": "2020-06-02",
      "body": "@Sorunome Typed rooms are not a hard requirement of extensible profiles. It's possible to point at a generic room, say \"this is my profile room\", and have everything work. Alternatively you could simply say `!andrewm:amorgan.xyz` is my profile room.\r\n\r\nThere are lots of different ways to solve that particular problem. When this MSC was labelled, it was determined that it wasn't a hard requirement of any current \"core\" MSCs.",
