      "body": "@stalniy thanks for making this! Just two things need to be done before this is ready for review:\r\n* Please line wrap around 90 characters for easier review\r\n* Please [Sign Off](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.rst#sign-off) on the changes so we are able to merge the proposal later.\r\n",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2108#issuecomment-500861322"
