      "date": "2019-07-19",
      "body": "@mscbot resolve Users who log in with 3PIDs won't be told they're deactivated.\r\n\r\nImplementations can hash user's 3PIDs instead of removing them, thus allowing them to continue to check if a user is deactivated without keeping personal information about.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2181#issuecomment-513181722"
