      "body": "There is nothing show stopping here, but it is quite fiddly and convoluted (understandably) so I think we should be careful that these are the semantics we want going forward.\r\n\r\nOne thing I think that is missing is a list of deficiencies with the current spec (I may be blind), as currently its hard for me tell whether this proposal actually solves the problem it sets out to solve. (For example will the handling of soft-tombstoned rooms be any easier than the handling of multiple DMs in the current system, etc).",
