      "body": "Implementations:\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-js-sdk/pull/1028\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-react-sdk/pull/6390 (previously https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-react-sdk/pull/3395)\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/10413 (previously https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/5990), updated matrix-org/synapse#12168",
