      "date": "2021-05-21",
      "body": "Please unlock https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/2527. Being forced to send read receipts is one of the most privacy-invasive and annoying characteristic of matrix. The community should be allowed to ask questions and discuss possible solutions. Especially now that this PR has been converted back to draft, so things will be even slower then they used to be (and this has been an issue **for 5 years**).",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2285#issuecomment-845798577"
