      "date": "2021-05-21",
      "body": "This doesn't have a Synapse implementation, not even behind an experimental feature, so adding support for it in Element would do absolutely nothing until that is complete. Given this PR is marked as [WIP] - Draft, its very likely to still change a lot which would mean clients/servers won't wish to spend time implementing it.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2285#issuecomment-845802714"
