  "2631": [
    {
      "author": "richvdh",
      "date": "2020-06-12",
      "body": "Having insisted that @ismailgulek created this MSC, I'm now having doubts if it is necessary.\r\n\r\nThe C-S spec [says](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#recommendations-for-apns):\r\n\r\n> The exact format for sending APNS notifications is flexible and up to the client app and its' push gateway to agree on. As APNS requires that the sender has a private key owned by the app developer, each app must have its own push gateway.\r\n\r\nso that sounds like this field doesn't need to be in the spec at all: it's an implementation-specific detail for sygnal and riot-ios to agree on.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice for sygnal to document its API so that other app developers can host their own sygnal and make use of its features, but I don't think it needs to be in the spec.\r\n\r\nI'd love it if someone else on the spec team with more experience with push could weigh in on this though...",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2631#issuecomment-643311334"
    },
    {
      "author": "richvdh",
      "date": "2020-06-19",
      "body": "@ismailgulek: I've discussed this with @dbkr and he agrees with [me-from-7-days-ago](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2631#issuecomment-643311334) that [me-from-9-days-ago](https://github.com/matrix-org/sygnal/pull/127#discussion_r438199084) was talking nonsense, and that there is no need for this field to be in the spec.\r\n\r\nSorry for wasting your time :/. Suggest you go ahead and close this PR if you're happy.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2631#issuecomment-646535932"
    },
    {
      "author": "ismailgulek",
      "date": "2020-06-23",
      "body": "> @ismailgulek: I've discussed this with @dbkr and he agrees with [me-from-7-days-ago](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2631#issuecomment-643311334) that [me-from-9-days-ago](https://github.com/matrix-org/sygnal/pull/127#discussion_r438199084) was talking nonsense, and that there is no need for this field to be in the spec.\r\n> \r\n> Sorry for wasting your time :/. Suggest you go ahead and close this PR if you're happy.\r\n\r\nClosing this as decided to be not necessary.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/2631#issuecomment-648160291"
    }
  ],
