      "body": "I can't tell what the status of this is now, but I have problems with this issue every day. It creates a situation where someone forwards something by someone else, and everyone thinks they said it. Why not at least let the user caption their forwarded message. Or just say \"shoq forwarded this\" automatically. That doesn't require anything but what you have now with a caption added and solves most of the problem. It doesn't attempt a to find a perfect forward solution, just something that helps stop misattribution and misunderstandings. It's quite disruptive to the chat to have to backtrack and say \"hey, I didn't write that, I just forwarded it.\" ",
