      "author": "clokep",
      "date": "2021-04-09",
      "body": "I believe that this MSC is missing some security concerns from allowing arbitrary URLs. It *could* allow pivoting into internal infrastructure (e.g. [CVE-2021-21273 in Synapse](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/security/advisories/GHSA-v936-j8gp-9q3p)) or targeting arbitrary URLs.",
