      "body": "Hey @MurzNN, because I did not know this MSC exists, I began writing [MSC3864](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3864) and [MSC3865](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3865), which kind of overlap with this MSC.\r\n\r\nI separated overriding room attributes and user attributes, so overriding user attributes can happen on a global scope and a room scope ([got the idea from a discussion](https://matrix.to/#/!NasysSDfxKxZBzJJoE:matrix.org/$XbIjFaQP-U9uJU2uujULDYWbWUagcKAg64BS3eZC8EI?via=matrix.org&via=libera.chat&via=element.io)). However, as I see it, yours seems more reviewed and so more ready to implement. So I'm unsure if both approaches shall be decided upon or if we could merge both. If you (or others as well) have time to discuss this, I created a public room for that: [#mscs-3015-3864-3865:matrix.org](https://matrix.to/#/#mscs-3015-3864-3865:matrix.org)",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3015#issuecomment-1209240946"
