      "body": "Hi @babolivier,\r\n\r\nIf you'd be open to the idea, we notice this hasn't received attention in quite some time, and we'd like to adopt this proposal under the Presence v2 initiative (see #4495) to carry it over the finish line. Please do let me know your thoughts when you have the time. I believe this added fidelity is instrumental to getting presence towards where it needs to be.",
