      "author": "ShadowJonathan",
      "date": "2022-10-20",
      "body": "Heads up that with [`333264f` (#3391)](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3391/commits/333264fbe1d2ec8044d6c89ffe71cd1319d55a34), in response to feedback, I have changed the semantics of the MSC, the most important one is the removal of \"`removed_events`\" from sync, and redefining `{}` account data as \"deleted\" across the board. This simplifies the MSC and related changes going forward.",
