      "author": "richvdh",
      "date": "2025-02-05",
      "body": "This seems to be bitrotting, with no real interest from a maintainer. I also think it's overreaching somewhat: we have basically the same semantics in the ecosystem today, with clients explicitly setting account data to `{}` to effectively mean \"deleted\".\r\n\r\nI'd like to propose this for closure.\r\n\r\n@mscbot fcp close",
