  "3682": [
    {
      "author": "anoadragon453",
      "date": "2022-11-18",
      "body": "Note to future implementers: if your project has implemented [MSC3391](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3391) then you may need to be cautious about when you fully \"delete\" an account data entry. Make sure you inform application services of the change first before you do!\r\n\r\nThe second half of the description of https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/14244 has some details about the implementation of MSC3391 in Synapse and tracking when a user's devices has seen an account data item be deleted.\r\n\r\nI don't imagine it'll be too bad as we'll likely inform application services of changes to account data right away - but just something to consider for your reliability model.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3682#issuecomment-1320415815"
    }
  ],
