  "3720": [
    {
      "author": "babolivier",
      "date": "2022-02-15",
      "body": "Synapse implementation: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/12001 (added to the PR's description)",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3720#issuecomment-1040508357"
    },
    {
      "author": "anoadragon453",
      "date": "2022-02-16",
      "body": "@babolivier Thanks for linking the implementation. Could I ask whether it has been used in any deployments?",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3720#issuecomment-1041352915"
    },
    {
      "author": "babolivier",
      "date": "2022-02-16",
      "body": "@anoadragon453 \r\n\r\n> Could I ask whether it has been used in any deployments used?\r\n\r\nNot as is. A similar feature exists in the fork of Synapse used by the French government deployment (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse-dinsic/pull/46), which this MSC is based on with a few adjustments (the initial intent of this MSC is to mainline this feature, though as noted in the introduction it also addresses other issues in the ecosystem). The main differences between this MSC and the implementation in `synapse-dinsic` are:\r\n\r\n* the client endpoint uses a `POST` request (the federation one is a `GET`). This MSC makes it a `GET` for consistency with the federation endpoint (and to make the implementation easier); however if people think the client-side endpoint should be a `POST` (because eg query parameters show as logs) then I'm happy to change it.\r\n* the implementation in `synapse-dinsic` doesn't account for non-existing users.\r\n* the implementation in `synapse-dinsic` doesn't account for federation failures.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3720#issuecomment-1041362858"
    },
    {
      "author": "babolivier",
      "date": "2026-07-20",
      "body": "Heads up I am formally abandoning this proposal since I don't currently have time for Matrix spec contributions (I'm not sure whether I should close it or wait for someone to adopt it).",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3720#issuecomment-5026702542"
    }
  ],
