      "body": "No. Make a generic \"bio\" section for the loonies to type that stuff. Making it part of the protocol is making a political statement in favor of lunacy.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3755#issuecomment-1079496829"
