      "body": "The final comment period, with a disposition to **merge**, as per [the review](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3824#issuecomment-3356178547) above, is now **complete**.",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/3824#issuecomment-3567420768"
