      "body": "This has gone through quite a bit of changes since the last FCP and has been simplified a lot. The proposed Synapse implementation has been updated so it still seems quite doable. The proposal mostly boils down to \"allow keys other than `displayname` and `avatar_url` on the `/profile` endpoints\" (with more details and edge cases).\r\n\r\nAnyway -- I again think this is now ready for merge.\r\n\r\n@mscbot fcp merge",
