      "body": "Current status of Matrix 2.0 video calls via LiveKit (MSC4143) on Element X\r\n\r\nDoes anyone have video calls working with Matrix 2.0 via LiveKit (MSC4143) when connecting from Element X?\r\n\r\nCurrently, Matrix 2.0 video calls via LiveKit work perfectly and smoothly when using a web browser. However, my attempts to debug(LiveKit server) the connection on Element X have been unsuccessful. The client terminates the connection immediately after successful authentication and joining the room. It’s currently impossible to determine why Element X drops the connection at that stage.\r\n\r\nI’m seeing requests hitting the /get_token endpoint(200), but the media pipeline fails shortly after .\r\n\r\nDebugging Element X itself is the \"Way of the Samurai\" (an uphill battle)...\r\n\r\nEverything is running on the latest versions",
