      "author": "turt2live",
      "date": "2026-08-03",
      "body": "@mscbot fcp merge\r\n@mscbot concern Dependency - Sticky events\r\n@mscbot concern Dependency - Transports registry (concurrent FCP)\r\n\r\nIf for whatever reason the transports registry fails to enter a merge FCP, we'll need to reincorporate its contents into this proposal.",
