      "body": "Following up on @turt2live's outstanding concerns:\r\n\r\n> @mscbot concern Discussion on forward compatability ordering needs resolution (and possible implementation)\r\n\r\nI think this is referring to https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4155#pullrequestreview-2116333237, though I wouldn't characterise that thread as being primarily about forward compatibility: indeed I'm not sure we have any practical proposals to provide forward compatibility.\r\n\r\n> @mscbot concern Discussion on global enable/disable thread needs resolution (and possible implementation)\r\n\r\nI think this is referring to https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4155#discussion_r2284091151; the proposal has been updated, but the sample implementation is still lacking support.\r\n",
