      "body": ":bell: This is now entering its final comment period, as per [the review](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4191#issuecomment-3330262419) above. :bell:",
      "url": "https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4191#issuecomment-3544828190"
