      "date": "2025-03-24",
      "body": "For the \"needs-implementation\" label on this MSC, one could consider implementation as \"removing support for legacy mentions\". However, I doubt a client will actually remove backwards-compatibility support for a feature until it's official removed from the spec. So it seems we're at a stalemate.\r\n\r\nIn the interest of unblocking it, I propose moving forwards with this MSC. The amount of client implementation shown in https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4210#discussion_r2009117566 demonstrates to me that the ecosystem is ready to move forwards.\r\n\r\n@mscbot fcp merge",
